{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260209001501a9edf1abf6124e23","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_ebc955fa668d4653b295c93a","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/ac/Projetos/site-pixel-alchemy/site-pixel-alchemy/site-demo/dra-amanda-gaipo/index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Dra. Amanda Gaipo | Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dra. Amanda Gaipo - Especialista em harmonização facial e estética avançada em Ribeirão Preto. Transforme sua beleza natural com tratamentos personalizados. Agende: (16) 99456-3928\">\n\n    <!-- Google Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500&family=Lato:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <style>\n        /* ========================================\n           CSS VARIABLES & ROOT STYLES\n        ======================================== */\n        :root {\n            /* Colors - Twilight Lavender & Mocha Palette */\n            --color-lavender: #B8A5C4;\n            --color-lavender-light: #D4C5E0;\n            --color-lavender-dark: #9A84A8;\n            --color-lavender-pale: #EBE5F0;\n            --color-mocha: #C4B5A8;\n            --color-mocha-dark: #A89484;\n            --color-mocha-light: #D9CFC6;\n            --color-champagne: #F5EDE3;\n            --color-cream: #FFFEFA;\n            --color-cream-dark: #F0EDE8;\n            --color-charcoal: #2A2A2A;\n            --color-charcoal-light: #4A4A4A;\n            --color-rose-gold: #C9A86C;\n            --color-rose-gold-light: #D9BE9A;\n\n            /* Gradients */\n            --gradient-twilight: linear-gradient(135deg, #EBE5F0 0%, #F5EDE3 50%, #FFFEFA 100%);\n            --gradient-lavender: linear-gradient(135deg, #B8A5C4 0%, #D4C5E0 100%);\n            --gradient-mocha: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5A8 0%, #D9CFC6 100%);\n            --gradient-warm: linear-gradient(135deg, #C9A86C 0%, #D9BE9A 100%);\n            --gradient-fade: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(235,229,240,0) 0%, rgba(235,229,240,1) 100%);\n\n            /* Typography */\n            --font-display: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;\n            --font-body: 'Lato', -apple-system, sans-serif;\n\n            /* Spacing */\n            --spacing-xs: 0.5rem;\n            --spacing-sm: 1rem;\n            --spacing-md: 2rem;\n            --spacing-lg: 4rem;\n            --spacing-xl: 6rem;\n            --spacing-xxl: 8rem;\n\n            /* Border Radius */\n            --radius-sm: 8px;\n            --radius-md: 16px;\n            --radius-lg: 24px;\n            --radius-pill: 100px;\n            --radius-organic: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%;\n            --radius-organic-2: 40% 60% 70% 30% / 40% 70% 30% 60%;\n            --radius-organic-3: 50% 50% 40% 60% / 50% 40% 60% 50%;\n\n            /* Shadows */\n            --shadow-soft: 0 8px 32px rgba(184, 165, 196, 0.15);\n            --shadow-glow: 0 8px 48px rgba(201, 168, 108, 0.2);\n            --shadow-elegant: 0 16px 64px rgba(42, 42, 42, 0.08);\n            --shadow-floating: 0 20px 60px rgba(184, 165, 196, 0.2);\n\n            /* Transitions */\n            --transition-fast: 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n            --transition-base: 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n            --transition-slow: 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           RESET & BASE STYLES\n        ======================================== */\n        *, *::before, *::after {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n\n        html {\n            scroll-behavior: smooth;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            background: var(--color-cream);\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            line-height: 1.7;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n        }\n\n        img {\n            max-width: 100%;\n            height: auto;\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        a {\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: inherit;\n            transition: var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        ul {\n            list-style: none;\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           TYPOGRAPHY\n        ======================================== */\n        h1, h2, h3, h4 {\n            font-family: var(--font-display);\n            font-weight: 500;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n        }\n\n        h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 5rem);\n            letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n        }\n\n        h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);\n            letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n        }\n\n        h3 {\n            font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);\n        }\n\n        .text-lavender { color: var(--color-lavender-dark); }\n        .text-mocha { color: var(--color-mocha-dark); }\n        .text-gold { color: var(--color-rose-gold); }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           NAVIGATION\n        ======================================== */\n        .nav {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            background: rgba(255, 254, 250, 0.95);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n            z-index: 1000;\n            transition: transform var(--transition-base);\n            box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(184, 165, 196, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .nav.hidden {\n            transform: translateY(-100%);\n        }\n\n        .nav-container {\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 1rem 2rem;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .nav-logo {\n            font-family: var(--font-display);\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n        }\n\n        .nav-menu {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 2rem;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .nav-link {\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal-light);\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .nav-link::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: -4px;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 0;\n            height: 2px;\n            background: var(--color-lavender-dark);\n            transition: width var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .nav-link:hover::after {\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .nav-cta {\n            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;\n            background: var(--color-lavender);\n            color: white;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .nav-cta:hover {\n            background: var(--color-lavender-dark);\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n        }\n\n        .mobile-toggle {\n            display: none;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 5px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            padding: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .mobile-toggle span {\n            width: 25px;\n            height: 2px;\n            background: var(--color-charcoal);\n            transition: var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           HERO SECTION\n        ======================================== */\n        .hero {\n            position: relative;\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            background: var(--gradient-twilight);\n        }\n\n        .hero-blobs {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n\n        .blob {\n            position: absolute;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-organic);\n            filter: blur(60px);\n            opacity: 0.6;\n            animation: blob-float 20s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        .blob-1 {\n            width: 500px;\n            height: 500px;\n            background: var(--gradient-lavender);\n            top: -10%;\n            right: -5%;\n            animation-delay: 0s;\n        }\n\n        .blob-2 {\n            width: 400px;\n            height: 400px;\n            background: var(--gradient-mocha);\n            bottom: -5%;\n            left: -10%;\n            animation-delay: -5s;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-organic-2);\n        }\n\n        .blob-3 {\n            width: 350px;\n            height: 350px;\n            background: var(--gradient-warm);\n            top: 40%;\n            left: 30%;\n            animation-delay: -10s;\n            opacity: 0.4;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-organic-3);\n        }\n\n        .blob-4 {\n            width: 300px;\n            height: 300px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #D4C5E0 0%, #F5EDE3 100%);\n            bottom: 20%;\n            right: 20%;\n            animation-delay: -15s;\n            opacity: 0.3;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-organic);\n        }\n\n        @keyframes blob-float {\n            0%, 100% {\n                transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1) rotate(0deg);\n            }\n            25% {\n                transform: translate(30px, -30px) scale(1.05) rotate(5deg);\n            }\n            50% {\n                transform: translate(-20px, 20px) scale(0.95) rotate(-5deg);\n            }\n            75% {\n                transform: translate(-30px, -20px) scale(1.02) rotate(3deg);\n            }\n        }\n\n        .hero-container {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 10;\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 6rem 2rem 4rem;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 4rem;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .hero-content {\n            animation: fade-up 1s ease-out;\n        }\n\n        .hero-badge {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n            background: rgba(184, 165, 196, 0.2);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--color-lavender-dark);\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            animation: fade-up 1s ease-out 0.2s both;\n        }\n\n        .hero-badge svg {\n            width: 16px;\n            height: 16px;\n        }\n\n        .hero-title {\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            animation: fade-up 1s ease-out 0.4s both;\n        }\n\n        .hero-title span {\n            color: var(--color-lavender-dark);\n        }\n\n        .hero-description {\n            font-size: 1.15rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal-light);\n            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;\n            max-width: 500px;\n            animation: fade-up 1s ease-out 0.6s both;\n        }\n\n        .hero-ctas {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 1rem;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            animation: fade-up 1s ease-out 0.8s both;\n        }\n\n        .btn {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            padding: 1rem 2rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n            border: none;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary {\n            background: var(--color-lavender);\n            color: white;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary:hover {\n            background: var(--color-lavender-dark);\n            transform: translateY(-3px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);\n        }\n\n        .btn-secondary {\n            background: transparent;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            border: 2px solid var(--color-mocha);\n        }\n\n        .btn-secondary:hover {\n            background: var(--color-mocha);\n            color: white;\n            transform: translateY(-3px);\n        }\n\n        .btn svg {\n            width: 18px;\n            height: 18px;\n        }\n\n        .hero-image {\n            position: relative;\n            animation: fade-up 1s ease-out 0.4s both;\n        }\n\n        .hero-image-wrapper {\n            position: relative;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-elegant);\n        }\n\n        .hero-image-wrapper::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background: var(--gradient-lavender);\n            opacity: 0.1;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n\n        .hero-image img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: auto;\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        .hero-floating-card {\n            position: absolute;\n            background: white;\n            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 1rem;\n            z-index: 10;\n            animation: card-float 6s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        .hero-floating-card.card-1 {\n            top: 10%;\n            left: -20px;\n        }\n\n        .hero-floating-card.card-2 {\n            bottom: 15%;\n            right: -20px;\n            animation-delay: -3s;\n        }\n\n        .card-icon {\n            width: 40px;\n            height: 40px;\n            background: var(--gradient-lavender);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n\n        .card-icon svg {\n            width: 20px;\n            height: 20px;\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        .card-text {\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n        }\n\n        .card-text small {\n            display: block;\n            font-weight: 400;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal-light);\n            font-size: 0.75rem;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes card-float {\n            0%, 100% {\n                transform: translateY(0);\n            }\n            50% {\n                transform: translateY(-15px);\n            }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes fade-up {\n            from {\n                opacity: 0;\n                transform: translateY(30px);\n            }\n            to {\n                opacity: 1;\n                transform: translateY(0);\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           SECTIONS BASE\n        ======================================== */\n        .section {\n            padding: var(--spacing-xl) 2rem;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .section-container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .section-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .section-tag {\n            display: inline-block;\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--color-lavender-dark);\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .section-title {\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .section-description {\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal-light);\n            max-width: 600px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           PROBLEM/SOLUTION SECTION\n        ======================================== */\n        .problem-solution {\n            background: var(--color-cream);\n        }\n\n        .problem-solution-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 3rem;\n            margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .problem-card, .solution-card {\n            background: white;\n            padding: 2.5rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n            transition: all var(--transition-base);\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .problem-card::before, .solution-card::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            height: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .problem-card::before {\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-mocha-dark), var(--color-mocha));\n        }\n\n        .solution-card::before {\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-lavender-dark), var(--color-lavender));\n        }\n\n        .problem-card:hover, .solution-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);\n        }\n\n        .card-icon-header {\n            width: 60px;\n            height: 60px;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .problem-card .card-icon-header {\n            background: rgba(196, 181, 168, 0.2);\n        }\n\n        .solution-card .card-icon-header {\n            background: rgba(184, 165, 196, 0.2);\n        }\n\n        .card-icon-header svg {\n            width: 30px;\n            height: 30px;\n        }\n\n        .problem-card .card-icon-header svg {\n            color: var(--color-mocha-dark);\n        }\n\n        .solution-card .card-icon-header svg {\n            color: var(--color-lavender-dark);\n        }\n\n        .problem-card h3, .solution-card h3 {\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n        }\n\n        .problem-card p, .solution-card p {\n            color: var(--color-charcoal-light);\n            line-height: 1.8;\n        }\n\n        .problem-list {\n            margin-top: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .problem-list li {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            gap: 0.75rem;\n            padding: 0.75rem 0;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-cream-dark);\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal-light);\n        }\n\n        .problem-list li:last-child {\n            border-bottom: none;\n        }\n\n        .problem-list svg {\n            width: 18px;\n            height: 18px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n            margin-top: 2px;\n        }\n\n        .problem-card .problem-list svg {\n            color: var(--color-mocha-dark);\n        }\n\n        .solution-card .problem-list svg {\n            color: var(--color-lavender-dark);\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           SERVICES SECTION\n        ======================================== */\n        .services {\n            background: var(--gradient-fade);\n        }\n\n        .services-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n            gap: 2rem;\n            margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .service-card {\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            padding: 2rem;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n            transition: all var(--transition-base);\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            cursor: pointer;\n        }\n\n        .service-card::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            background: var(--gradient-lavender);\n            opacity: 0;\n            transition: opacity var(--transition-base);\n            z-index: 0;\n        }\n\n        .service-card:hover::before {\n            opacity: 0.05;\n        }\n\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);\n        }\n\n        .service-icon {\n            width: 60px;\n            height: 60px;\n            background: var(--gradient-lavender);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n\n        .service-icon svg {\n            width: 28px;\n            height: 28px;\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        .service-card h3 {\n            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n\n        .service-card p {\n            color: var(--color-charcoal-light);\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n\n        .service-link {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            color: var(--color-lavender-dark);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 1;\n            transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .service-link:hover {\n            gap: 0.75rem;\n            color: var(--color-lavender);\n        }\n\n        .service-link svg {\n            width: 16px;\n            height: 16px;\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           TESTIMONIALS SECTION\n        ======================================== */\n        .testimonials {\n            background: var(--color-cream);\n        }\n\n        .testimonials-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n            gap: 2rem;\n            margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-card {\n            background: white;\n            padding: 2rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n            transition: all var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-stars {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 0.25rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-stars svg {\n            width: 18px;\n            height: 18px;\n            fill: var(--color-rose-gold);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-text {\n            font-style: italic;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal-light);\n            line-height: 1.8;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-author {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-avatar {\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            background: var(--gradient-lavender);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: white;\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-info h4 {\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-info p {\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal-light);\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           DIFFERENTIALS SECTION\n        ======================================== */\n        .differentials {\n            background: var(--gradient-twilight);\n        }\n\n        .differentials-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n            gap: 2rem;\n            margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .differential-item {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 2rem;\n            transition: all var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        .differential-icon {\n            width: 80px;\n            height: 80px;\n            margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .differential-icon::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -4px;\n            left: -4px;\n            right: -4px;\n            bottom: -4px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            background: var(--gradient-lavender);\n            opacity: 0.3;\n            z-index: -1;\n            animation: pulse-ring 2s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes pulse-ring {\n            0%, 100% {\n                transform: scale(1);\n                opacity: 0.3;\n            }\n            50% {\n                transform: scale(1.1);\n                opacity: 0.1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .differential-icon svg {\n            width: 35px;\n            height: 35px;\n            color: var(--color-lavender-dark);\n        }\n\n        .differential-item h3 {\n            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n        }\n\n        .differential-item p {\n            color: var(--color-charcoal-light);\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           CONTACT SECTION\n        ======================================== */\n        .contact {\n            background: var(--color-cream);\n        }\n\n        .contact-container {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 4rem;\n            margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .contact-info h3 {\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n        }\n\n        .contact-info p {\n            color: var(--color-charcoal-light);\n            margin-bottom: 2rem;\n            line-height: 1.8;\n        }\n\n        .contact-details {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .contact-item {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            gap: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .contact-item-icon {\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            background: var(--gradient-lavender);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n\n        .contact-item-icon svg {\n            width: 24px;\n            height: 24px;\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        .contact-item-text h4 {\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        .contact-item-text p {\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal-light);\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        .contact-item-text a {\n            color: var(--color-lavender-dark);\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        .contact-item-text a:hover {\n            color: var(--color-lavender);\n        }\n\n        .contact-form-wrapper {\n            background: white;\n            padding: 2.5rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n        }\n\n        .contact-form h3 {\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n        }\n\n        .form-group {\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .form-group label {\n            display: block;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n\n        .form-group input,\n        .form-group select,\n        .form-group textarea {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 1rem;\n            border: 2px solid var(--color-cream-dark);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n            background: var(--color-cream);\n        }\n\n        .form-group input:focus,\n        .form-group select:focus,\n        .form-group textarea:focus {\n            outline: none;\n            border-color: var(--color-lavender);\n            background: white;\n        }\n\n        .form-group textarea {\n            resize: vertical;\n            min-height: 120px;\n        }\n\n        .form-submit {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 1rem 2rem;\n            background: var(--color-lavender);\n            color: white;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .form-submit:hover {\n            background: var(--color-lavender-dark);\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n        }\n\n        .form-submit svg {\n            width: 18px;\n            height: 18px;\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           FOOTER\n        ======================================== */\n        .footer {\n            background: var(--color-charcoal);\n            color: var(--color-cream);\n            padding: 4rem 2rem 2rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer-container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .footer-content {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 4rem;\n            margin-bottom: 3rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer-brand h3 {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        .footer-brand p {\n            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n            line-height: 1.8;\n            max-width: 350px;\n        }\n\n        .footer-links h4 {\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        .footer-links ul {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 0.75rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer-links a {\n            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            transition: color var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .footer-links a:hover {\n            color: var(--color-lavender-light);\n        }\n\n        .footer-bottom {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding-top: 2rem;\n            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .footer-bottom p {\n            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer-social {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer-social a {\n            width: 40px;\n            height: 40px;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .footer-social a:hover {\n            background: var(--color-lavender);\n            transform: translateY(-3px);\n        }\n\n        .footer-social svg {\n            width: 18px;\n            height: 18px;\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           SCROLL ANIMATIONS\n        ======================================== */\n        .wow-fade-up {\n            opacity: 0;\n            transform: translateY(30px);\n            transition: opacity 0.8s ease, transform 0.8s ease;\n        }\n\n        .wow-fade-up.visible {\n            opacity: 1;\n            transform: translateY(0);\n        }\n\n        .wow-fade-up[data-delay] {\n            transition-delay: calc(var(--delay) * 1ms);\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           RESPONSIVE DESIGN\n        ======================================== */\n        @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n            .hero-container {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                text-align: center;\n            }\n\n            .hero-description {\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n            }\n\n            .hero-ctas {\n                justify-content: center;\n            }\n\n            .hero-image {\n                order: -1;\n            }\n\n            .hero-floating-card.card-1 {\n                left: 0;\n            }\n\n            .hero-floating-card.card-2 {\n                right: 0;\n            }\n\n            .services-grid,\n            .testimonials-grid,\n            .differentials-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            }\n\n            .contact-container {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .footer-content {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                gap: 2rem;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .nav-menu {\n                position: fixed;\n                top: 70px;\n                left: 0;\n                right: 0;\n                flex-direction: column;\n                background: white;\n                padding: 2rem;\n                gap: 1.5rem;\n                transform: translateY(-150%);\n                transition: transform var(--transition-base);\n                box-shadow: var(--shadow-elegant);\n            }\n\n            .nav-menu.active {\n                transform: translateY(0);\n            }\n\n            .mobile-toggle {\n                display: flex;\n            }\n\n            .problem-solution-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .services-grid,\n            .testimonials-grid,\n            .differentials-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 480px) {\n            .hero-ctas {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n\n            .btn {\n                width: 100%;\n                justify-content: center;\n            }\n\n            .hero-floating-card {\n                display: none;\n            }\n\n            .section {\n                padding: var(--spacing-lg) 1.5rem;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           ACCESSIBILITY\n        ======================================== */\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            *,\n            *::before,\n            *::after {\n                animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n                animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n                transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n            }\n        }\n\n        :focus-visible {\n            outline: 3px solid var(--color-lavender);\n            outline-offset: 2px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"nav\">\n        <div class=\"nav-container\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-logo\">Dra. Amanda Gaipo</a>\n            <div class=\"mobile-toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\">\n                <span></span>\n                <span></span>\n                <span></span>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"nav-menu\">\n                <li><a href=\"#home\" class=\"nav-link\">Início</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#services\" class=\"nav-link\">Tratamentos</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#testimonials\" class=\"nav-link\">Depoimentos</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#contact\" class=\"nav-cta\">Agendar Consulta</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Hero Section -->\n    <section class=\"hero\" id=\"home\">\n        <div class=\"hero-blobs\">\n            <div class=\"blob blob-1\"></div>\n            <div class=\"blob blob-2\"></div>\n            <div class=\"blob blob-3\"></div>\n            <div class=\"blob blob-4\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"hero-container\">\n            <div class=\"hero-content\">\n                <div class=\"hero-badge\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <path d=\"M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z\"/>\n                    </svg>\n                    Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n                </div>\n                <h1 class=\"hero-title\">Sua beleza natural, <span>potencializada</span></h1>\n                <p class=\"hero-description\">Transforme sua aparência com tratamentos estéticos personalizados que realçam seus traços naturais. Tecnologia avançada e cuidado humanizado.</p>\n                <div class=\"hero-ctas\">\n                    <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">\n                        Agendar Avaliação\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"#services\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">\n                        Conhecer Tratamentos\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"hero-image\">\n                <div class=\"hero-image-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1629909613654-28e377c37b09?w=800&q=80\" alt=\"Harmonização Facial - Dra. Amanda Gaipo\">\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"hero-floating-card card-1\">\n                    <div class=\"card-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-text\">\n                        +5.000\n                        <small>Atendimentos Realizados</small>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"hero-floating-card card-2\">\n                    <div class=\"card-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"/>\n                            <polyline points=\"22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-text\">\n                        98% Satisfação\n                        <small>Clientes Felizes</small>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Problem/Solution Section -->\n    <section class=\"section problem-solution\">\n        <div class=\"section-container\">\n            <div class=\"section-header wow-fade-up\">\n                <span class=\"section-tag\">Transformação Real</span>\n                <h2 class=\"section-title\">Sua autoestima merece prioridade</h2>\n                <p class=\"section-description\">Entendemos suas preocupações e oferecemos soluções que transformam não apenas sua aparência, mas sua confiança.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"problem-solution-grid\">\n                <div class=\"problem-card wow-fade-up\" data-delay=\"200\">\n                    <div class=\"card-icon-header\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2\"/>\n                            <line x1=\"9\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"9.01\" y2=\"9\"/>\n                            <line x1=\"15\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"15.01\" y2=\"9\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>O que te incomoda?</h3>\n                    <p>Muitas pessoas enfrentam inseguranças com sua aparência que afetam sua autoestima e bem-estar.</p>\n                    <ul class=\"problem-list\">\n                        <li>\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            Perda de contorno facial\n                        </li>\n                        <li>\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            Rugas e linhas de expressão\n                        </li>\n                        <li>\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            Falta de harmonia nos traços\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"solution-card wow-fade-up\" data-delay=\"400\">\n                    <div class=\"card-icon-header\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"/>\n                            <polyline points=\"22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>Nossa solução para você</h3>\n                    <p>Com tecnologia avançada e abordagem personalizada, realizamos transformações naturais que realçam sua beleza única.</p>\n                    <ul class=\"problem-list\">\n                        <li>\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                                <polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            Resultados naturais e harmoniosos\n                        </li>\n                        <li>\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                                <polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            Procedimentos seguros e aprovados\n                        </li>\n                        <li>\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                                <polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            Acompanhamento personalizado\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Services Section -->\n    <section class=\"section services\" id=\"services\">\n        <div class=\"section-container\">\n            <div class=\"section-header wow-fade-up\">\n                <span class=\"section-tag\">Tratamentos</span>\n                <h2 class=\"section-title\">Procedimentos especializados</h2>\n                <p class=\"section-description\">Oferecemos uma gama completa de tratamentos estéticos faciais com tecnologia de ponta.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"services-grid\">\n                <div class=\"service-card wow-fade-up\" data-delay=\"0\">\n                    <div class=\"service-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path d=\"M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>Harmonização Facial</h3>\n                    <p>Equilíbrio estético dos traços faciais com preenchedores e toxina botulínica para uma aparência natural e harmônica.</p>\n                    <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"service-link\">\n                        Saiba mais\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"service-card wow-fade-up\" data-delay=\"100\">\n                    <div class=\"service-icon\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path d=\"M9 12h6M12 9v6\"/>\n                            <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>Toxina Botulínica</h3>\n                    <p>Suaviza linhas de expressão e rugas, prevenindo o envelhecimento 